WEBVTT

1.1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.418
Step 1. Open the dispense order.

1.2
00:00:02.418 --> 00:00:07.161
Here you change the dispenses of an open order before you complete it.

1.3
00:00:07.161 --> 00:00:12.810
From Dispense in the location sidebar, select View Order on the Pending tab.

2.1
00:00:12.810 --> 00:00:17.214
Step 2. Change the lot, quantity or product of a dispense.

2.2
00:00:17.214 --> 00:00:22.801
Select Edit Dispense, change the lot or the Quantity, and select Save Changes.

2.3
00:00:22.801 --> 00:00:26.309
Care replaces the dispense with a new one.

3.1
00:00:26.309 --> 00:00:32.342
Step 3. Change the status of a dispense. Select the new status in the Status column.

3.2
00:00:32.342 --> 00:00:38.281
While the dispense has no invoice, or only a draft one, you can also cancel it.

4.1
00:00:38.281 --> 00:00:40.943
Step 4. Add a medicine to the order.

4.2
00:00:40.943 --> 00:00:45.834
Search for the product in Add Medication, set the Frequency and Duration,

4.3
00:00:45.834 --> 00:01:01.997
and select Add Medication. Care adds it with the status Preparation.
